    {
      "id": 1,
      "speaker": "JUDGE KWON",
      "role": "judge",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Good morning to you all. I hope everybody has a restful break. Unless there are any matters to be dealt with, we'll go into closed session since we're going to hear the witness in closed session. Yes, Mr. Robinson."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "speaker": "MR. ROBINSON",
      "role": "counsel",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Yes, Mr. President. I could indicate to the Trial Chamber that we have no position on the Prosecution's motion to subpoena Witness KDZ-532, and we won't be filing anything in connection with that. And also if I could put on the record that we object to the closed session for the next witness, KDZ-492, although when we spoke with him during the interview, he indicated that he maintained his position that he wanted to testify in closed session. So we have no new information to provide to the Chamber."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "JUDGE KWON",
      "role": "judge",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Shall we go into closed session."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "speaker": "JUDGE KWON",
